      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To start your strength journey, focus on mastering good form with compound lifts. For this 4-week linear progression, aim to increase the weight slightly each week on your squat, bench press, and deadlifts. Keep the rep range relatively low, perhaps 3-5 sets of 5 reps, and prioritize weight progression over high volume initially. Remember to always warm up thoroughly before lifting!",
